#: main.cpp:190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Behavior</h1> Here you can customize the way windows behave when "
"being moved, resized or clicked on. You can also specify a focus policy as well "
"as a placement policy for new windows. "
"<p>Please note that this configuration will not take effect if you do not use "
"KWin as your window manager. If you do use a different window manager, please "
"refer to its documentation for how to customize window behavior."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Reftarê pencerê</h1>livir tu kari sazbike, ku çawa pencer reftar bike, hema "
"ku te endaza wî, cihê wî guhirt yan ji wî qirtand. Herwîsa tu kari sazbiki ku "
"aktîv kirin û cihgor kirina pencerên nuh çawa bibe."
"<p>Fermo agehdar be, ku hew danan karîger nabe dema ku tu KWin ne weku "
"berêveberê penceran bikarbîne. Heger tu managerek din yên Pencera "
"bikardîne,fermo dokumentationan bixwîne, jibo ku tu zanibe reftarên penceran ji "
"xwe re çawa çê bikî."

